                            </td>
                        
                    
                
                    
                        
                        
                        
                            <td>
                                <p>Yes, with Alexa Voice Remote (included) or the free <a href="https://www.amazon.com/b?node=216752230011">Fire TV app</a> (available for download on Fire OS, Android, and iOS).</p>

