3-4ea8-bea9-9ce60bded67f k-composed=SnippetList_asp_100_25 k-parent=179d5ac6-9d70-4444-8520-64c07330a7de k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z"><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-expand=snippet_36_21 k-id=e27c8de1-7ce4-475f-b3bc-3e8dfcabaef3 k-parent=664bf76b-7b43-4ea8-bea9-9ce60bded67f k-data=[omitted] k-init--><div style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z __P0nNOOvpt01x"><div data-csa-c-type="uxElement" data-csa-c-item-id="cr-product-insights-detail-page_read-more-link" data-csa-c-pos="" data-csa-c-posx="" data-csa-c-posy="" data-csa-c-owner="CustomerReviews" data-csa-c-item-type="" data-csa-c-parent-element-id="" class="aui-primitive" data-csa-c-slot-id="cr-product-insights-detail-page_read-more-link" data-csa-c-id="4kdafs-rbfkvw-x8dkgj-bfa91s"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">"</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">...It is NOT a 4k TV. But still a </span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ __SARCET4AB">great picture</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">, or so I thought. I started having glitches and memory problems with the roku unit....</span></span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive __SAR2l0zNyyuZ">"</span><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive"> </span><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=TextLink-vGphR3AGo9p_JGZ k-id=c9098666-76ff-4039-868e-da1577e1fda2 k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-var-addr=/MainView_summar_105_5/aspectReadMoreE_320_13/BottomSheetCont_226_21/aspect_72_22/4/SnippetList_asp_100_25/snippet_36_21/0