d" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>I'm no IT gal but, my new fire stick is great! Super easy to set up and install. I had an earlier version that worked well but my new stick is better. It enhanced my picture so much I'm shocked. It's like I up graded my tv. The picture is brighter and so crisp. My husband immediately bought one for his big TV he was going to replace. Yeah, it made his picture just as great as mine. Both televisions are faster and I'm able to increase my library size without affecting anything negatively. The remote is a little bigger and button placement changed a little. I like the new size. Simple to get used to. It is actually faster when I'm surfing and in general. Great purchase.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha a-hidden"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="qsoxm4-z2g0yj-6atcak-9k2ae1"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-top-small _Y3Itd_helpful-votes-container_3iphI"><span data-hoo