stomerrecognized="true" data-iskindleapp="false" data-isandroidapp="false" data-isiosapp="false" data-ismshop="false" data-marketplaceid="ATVPDKIKX0DER"><div id="ROJXPHINY8NYS" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-ROJXPHINY8NYS" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-hook="review" class="a-section aok-relative" data-csa-c-id="pf8f0-v2dojp-8lqeqq-3szrln"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHW6FLGPBLOBOY76J3KFEJ4WYMEQ?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-ROJXPHINY8NYS_profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="79foup-kdrybz-x2z3i3-2189os"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="./anker-hub_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"><noscript><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"/></noscript></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">Thomas S.</span></div></a></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/ROJXPHINY8NYS/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">It’s better than the other two fire sticks that Amazon sells.</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on May 28, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B0BP9SNVH9/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Configuration: Fire TV Stick 4K Max</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-7"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-7-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-7-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="true" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand" data-csa-c-id="gjl459-cen7yf-4hjbhz-8uic5w" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-7-card0"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>Very nice fire stick. If you’re thinking of getting a fire stick, I recommend you just go ahead and buy this one. I have all three versions in different places in my house. I have the lite, for example, in my garage. This one is noticeably quicker and snappier. Also ambiance mode is nice. It’s also nice to have the smart home features right there. I can’t attest to the remote, though, since I use the better remote that the sell.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>EDIT: I'm so upset with this thing.  It's been just under a year since we bought it (writing this August 2026, purchased September 2025).  A week ago I was still praising this fire stick.  Now out of nowhere and for seemingly no reason whatsoever, it has started crapping out on me.  It randomly freezes up on me and won't do anything, forcing me to unplug the device and wait, before plugging it back in and trying again, only for it to freeze up again a few minutes later.  The only thing I can find online that might help is to clear all the caches for the app that I use, which I've done, and it still keeps doing it.  You're suppose to be able to hold the center button and the play button to force a restart, but even that doesn't work MOST of the time and the two times it DID work, it got stuck on the "Your Fire TV is turning off" message, and never actually did so.  I have over half the storage space left, partially because I didn't have a ton of apps to begin with, and partially because I uninstalled a few hoping to resolve this issue.  I checked for software updates but its up to date, so that's not it either.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="c9xce2-1cxt37-eb6fp4-ugwx8x"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-top-small _Y3Itd_helpful-votes-container_3iphI"><span data-hook="helpful-vote-statement" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">29 people found this helpful</span></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="helpfulVoteWidget" class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_cr-voting-section_1cNTp"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-button_1u3UK cr-vote-component" data-hook="helpfulVoteButton" data-mix-operations="HelpfulVoteClickHandler" data-asin="B0BP9SNVH9" data-id="ROJXPHINY8NYS" data-return-to="DpReview" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-ROJXPHINY8NYS_helpful_button" data-csa-c-id="f3q0ou-iom70u-w2o45d-h04iff"><span class="a-button a-button-base" id="a-autoid-42"><span class="a-button-inner"><input type="submit" class="a-button-input" aria-labelledby="a-autoid-42-announce"><span class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true" id="a-autoid-42-announce"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-text-desktop_2dXQG">Helpful</div></span></span></span></div><span data-hook="helpfulVoteLoadingMessage" class="_Y3Itd_hidden_1J5OD">Sending feedback...</span><div data-hook="helpfulVoteSuccessMessage" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success _Y3Itd_hidden_1J5OD a-spacing-block" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content">Thank you for your feedback.</div></div>