6c-43c5-be9c-e6e4668c35b7._CR117%2C0%2C265%2C265_SX460_SX48_.jpg"/></noscript></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">Eddie Franco</span></div></a></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3E28DB502HIVH/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">Incredibly fast, crystal-clear 4K, and the AI search is a game-changer!</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on July 1, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B0BP9SNVH9/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Configuration: Fire TV Stick 4K Max</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-8"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-8-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-8-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="true" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="basic" data-csa-c-id="j3rjb0-smuy3u-wqbwgw-74exp5" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-8-card0"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition" style="height: 170px;"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>I am thoroughly impressed with the new Fire TV Stick 4K Max! The performance upgrade is immediately noticeable, apps launch instantly, and navigating through menus is fluid with absolutely zero lag. Thanks to the Wi-Fi 6E support, streaming 4K Ultra HD content is flawless, smooth, and buffers instantly without any drops in quality.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>The new AI-powered search is an awesome feature that makes finding exactly what you want to watch incredibly easy and intuitive, especially when pairing it with Alexa. I also love the massive selection of free and live TV options available right out of the box. It’s easily the best streaming device on the market today. Highly recommend!</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha a-hidden"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="7cwoj-ax56fh-959i00-4vvjmy"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-top-small _Y3Itd_helpful-votes-container_3iphI"><span data-hook="helpful-vote-statement" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">2 people found this helpful</span></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="helpfulVoteWidget" class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_cr-voting-section_1cNTp"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-button_1u3UK cr-vote-component" data-hook="helpfulVoteButton" data-mix-operations="HelpfulVoteClickHandler" data-asin="B0BP9SNVH9" data-id="R3E28DB502HIVH" data-return-to="DpReview" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R3E28DB502HIVH_helpful_button" data-csa-c-id="uro6z-9ngqsk-wjx06u-4xmv85"><span class="a-button a-button-base" id="a-autoid-45"><span class="a-button-inner"><input type="submit" class="a-button-input" aria-labelledby="a-autoid-45-announce"><span class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true" id="a-autoid-45-announce"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-text-desktop_2dXQG">Helpful</div></span></span></span></div><span data-hook="helpfulVoteLoadingMessage" class="_Y3Itd_hidden_1J5OD">Sending feedback...</span><div data-hook="helpfulVoteSuccessMessage" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success _Y3Itd_hidden_1J5OD a-spacing-block" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true